    {
     "t": "code",
     "v": "⌘K"
    },
    {
     "t": "text",
     "v": " and they are what shows in "
    },
    {
     "t": "link",
     "v": "Files",
     "href": "/docs/clusters/list-view",
     "children": [
      {
       "t": "text",
       "v": "Files"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "text",
     "v": ", so a card called \"Untitled\" is a card you will not find later."
    }
